{
  "version": 2,
  "description": "Path-based risk classification for POII pull requests. A PR touching any gated path is gated. Labels can raise a PR to gated, never lower it. Unclassifiable changes are gated. Changing this file is itself gated. Version 2 (2026-10-10) widens every class to where the code actually lives; sensitive-areas.json and check-coverage.mjs fail CI when a sensitive file is not matched here.",
